WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:02.424
Hi, I'm Fern!

00:00:02.424 --> 00:00:06.962
mini-AGI is a byte-level model that trains on one eight-gigabyte laptop card

00:00:06.962 --> 00:00:08.853
and grows its own experts.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:11.906
The experts live on disk.

00:00:11.906 --> 00:00:15.642
A slow router loads thirty-two per passage, a fast one picks eight

00:00:15.642 --> 00:00:17.821
per character, and the pool keeps growing.

00:00:20.925 --> 00:00:24.904
Every expert is a small MLP, stored as a file on disk.

00:00:24.904 --> 00:00:27.557
The published snapshot had a hundred and sixty-nine.

00:00:27.977 --> 00:00:32.116
Once every two thousand and forty-eight characters, a slow segment router chooses

00:00:32.116 --> 00:00:34.185
which thirty-two sit on the card.

00:00:34.605 --> 00:00:37.797
Each character runs one shared block up to twenty-four times.

00:00:37.797 --> 00:00:41.308
On every pass, a fast router picks eight of those thirty-two.

00:00:42.733 --> 00:00:46.291
The pool may add at most one expert every two million characters,

00:00:46.291 --> 00:00:48.069
and brakes refuse about a third.

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:51.568
A newborn isn't a clone or a random init.

00:00:51.568 --> 00:00:55.330
It's assembled from whole hidden units taken from sixteen trained parents.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:59.420
And an expert nothing loads for a hundred million characters is deleted,

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:00.949
so the pool shrinks too.

00:01:02.317 --> 00:01:05.874
Read half a million characters of chess with the shared trunk at

00:01:05.874 --> 00:01:09.135
full learning rate, and the seven unread subjects get two point

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:10.321
two three nats worse.

00:01:10.741 --> 00:01:14.173
Slow only the trunk to a tenth, and forgetting falls below

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:15.421
the probe's noise floor.

00:01:15.421 --> 00:01:19.164
That is the honest reading of zero point zero zero six seven.

00:01:20.725 --> 00:01:22.723
The finding is one multiplier.

00:01:22.723 --> 00:01:27.919
Slow the shared trunk's learning rate, and forgetting goes from catastrophic to unmeasurable.

00:01:29.442 --> 00:01:33.270
To recap: a slow router pages experts in, a fast one picks

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:35.503
eight, and a slower trunk stops forgetting.

00:01:35.923 --> 00:01:37.936
Every source is in the full article.

00:01:37.936 --> 00:01:38.511
I'm Fern.

00:01:38.511 --> 00:01:38.799
Bye!
